WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,400
Hanlu, there's someone outside the door. I'll go out and take a look.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:09,530
I beg you, do you have any antipyretics and anti-inflammatories?

3
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,530
Lend me two. The original juice was hit on the head by an ice pack.

4
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:12,530
If there is no medicine, I will die.

5
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:14,530
No. The medicine previously distributed by the government has been used up.

6
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:15,530
Find someone else

7
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,530
Yuan Jue obviously followed you out.

8
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,530
Why is he the one who gets hurt, not you?

9
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:21,520
Original juice follows me

10
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,520
Say what you just said again

11
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,520
When did the original juice follow me?

12
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,520
What on earth did he see?

13
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:28,520
He said he heard someone coming down from upstairs in the early morning.

14
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,520
He is the one you went out to look for supplies for.

15
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,520
So just follow it and take a look

16
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:32,520
Then what?

17
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,580
He said he didn't see anyone after he went downstairs.

18
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Just turn right nearby. I want to wait for you to come back.

19
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,580
Who knew there would suddenly be ice packs?

20
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:38,580
He was almost killed

21
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,580
It turns out he didn't follow me at all

22
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,580
Indeed, as long as someone comes close

23
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,580
My mental power can detect my breathing and heartbeat

24
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,580
The original juice cannot escape my perception

25
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,580
But he has set his sights on me

26
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,580
You need to be careful with this guy

27
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:47,580
I told you everything I know

28
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,580
I can't live without him

29
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,580
Original juice is following me and trying to steal my supplies.

30
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,580
You asked me to get medicine to save him

31
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:52,580
Is there anything wrong with your mind?

32
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,580
But he was injured after following you out.

33
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,580
You should be responsible

34
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:55,580
Don't say I have no medicine

35
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:56,580
Even if I can't save a Shiba Lang

36
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:59,220
Go home and turn the current to maximum

37
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:00,220
If you are not afraid of death, just come
